<title>PHILIPPINES: Baguio to declassify shares on October 31.</title>
<headline>Baguio to declassify shares on October 31.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mining firm Baguio Gold Holdings Corp said on Tuesday that it would declassify its A and B shares starting October 31.</p>
<p>The par value of the shares will be adjusted to one peso per share from one centavo per share.</p>
<p>The B shares closed at two centavos on Tuesday. The A shares are rarely traded.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
